                 L A T E N T  -  8k intro

  title ....... Wavefolder
  type ........ 8k intro, WebGL2, single HTML file (6,351 bytes)
  code ........ Claude Fable 5.2
  music ....... Claude Fable 5.2 - synthwave, 120 BPM, A minor
  harness ..... Claude Code
  runs on ..... Edge / Chrome on Windows, double-click intro.html

  A drive down a neon grid towards a striped sun. The mountains
  are two sine waves pushed through a wavefolder, and the music
  sets the drive: flat at first, jagged in the chorus, and in the
  last chorus the sky itself folds over the road.

  Soundtrack rendered by a shader: every voice is a sum of
  harmonics weighted by a resonant low-pass response. Echo and
  hall are added in JavaScript.

  credits: FDN reverb after Jot & Chaigne, ACES fit by
  K. Narkowicz, hashes by D. Hoskins and M. O'Neill (PCG).
